<title>PHILIPPINES: Easycall says 6-mth net 30.986 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Easycall says 6-mth net 30.986 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easycall Communications Phils Inc said on Monday its net income from July to December 1996, or the first six months of its current fiscal year, reached 30.986 million pesos.</p>
<p>The paging firm said in a filing with the Philippine Stock Exchange that its sales and service income in the same period reached 396.941 million pesos.</p>
<p>The firm did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
